Package: starch
Title: Read and Tidy Strava Bulk Export Archives
Version: 0.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Magnus Thor", "Torfason", , "m@zulutime.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads Strava bulk export archives into tidy, analysis-ready
    tables. Parses the 'activities.csv' index alongside the accompanying
    GPS track files in GPX, TCX, and FIT formats, reconciles their
    differing field sets into a common schema. The end result are tidy,
    starched, parquet files representing the STrava ARCHive.
